stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> validating
    validating --> unauthorized: actor is not an authorized partner
    validating --> invalid: malformed exact subject, category or limit
    validating --> reading: authorized and valid request
    reading --> unavailable: required source fails
    reading --> needs_input: subject, location or requirement is unknown
    reading --> empty: no supported eligible vendor
    reading --> ready: bounded sourced comparisons
